## Key Concepts
- Monocular 6-DoF pose estimation from visual cues
- CAD-model-guided PnP integration for geometric refinement
- Synthetic+real data strategy with domain randomization
- On-device few-shot adaptation on constrained edge GPUs
- Real-time tracking under partial occlusion and clutter

## Code Example
